FISCAL NOTE
The fiscal impact is indeterminable.
According to the Attorney General’s Office, this bill could potentially save the
state substantial legal and contractual service costs, and the potential costs of
judgements and settlements of claims. However, such potential savings cannot be
predicted and would depend on future litigation.
